---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Refund Policy" description="Refund policy for PCMC Diary paid listings.">
  <div class="page">
    <div class="page-container">
      <div class="page-header">
        <div class="page-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-left"></i></div>
        <h1>Refund Policy</h1>
        <p class="page-sub"><i class="fa-regular fa-calendar"></i> Last updated: 12 September 2026</p>
      </div>
      <div class="page-body">
        <section>
          <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> Overview</h2>
          <p>We want you to be satisfied with your PCMC Diary paid listing. If something doesn't work out, our refund policy is designed to be fair and transparent.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Refund Eligibility</h2>
          <p>You are eligible for a full refund if:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Request made within <strong>7 days</strong> of payment</li>
            <li>Your listing has not yet gone live on the website</li>
            <li>Duplicate payment made by mistake</li>
            <li>Technical failure prevented listing activation</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-xmark"></i> No Refund Cases</h2>
          <p>Refunds will not be provided if:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>More than 7 days have passed since payment</li>
            <li>Listing is already live and has received views/leads</li>
            <li>Request is made after the annual term expires</li>
            <li>Business has been removed for violating our Terms</li>
            <li>Change of mind after activation</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope-open-text"></i> How to Request</h2>
          <p>Email <a href="mailto:info@pcmcdiary.com">info@pcmcdiary.com</a> with:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Your business name and registered email</li>
            <li>Payment date and transaction ID</li>
            <li>Reason for refund</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2><i class="fa-regular fa-clock"></i> Processing Time</h2>
          <p>Approved refunds are processed within <strong>7–10 business days</strong>. The amount will be credited back to the original payment method.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i> Partial Refunds</h2>
          <p>In certain exceptional cases (e.g., service downtime exceeding 30 days), we may offer partial refunds on a pro-rata basis at our discretion.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-phone"></i> Contact</h2>
          <p>For refund queries:<br>
            Email: <a href="mailto:info@pcmcdiary.com">info@pcmcdiary.com</a><br>
            WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/918793932827" target="_blank" rel="noopener">+91 87939 32827</a></p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
.page { background: #f8fafc; padding: 40px 20px 80px; min-height: 60vh; }
.page-container { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 20px; padding: 48px 52px; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.04), 0 12px 32px -16px rgba(15,23,42,0.08); border: 1px solid #f1f5f9; }
.page-header { text-align: center; padding-bottom: 32px; margin-bottom: 32px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; }
.page-icon { width: 64px; height: 64px; margin: 0 auto 16px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0891b2, #0e7490); border-radius: 18px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 26px; color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 12px 24px -8px rgba(8,145,178,0.4); }
.page-header h1 { font-size: 34px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; letter-spacing: -0.8px; margin: 0 0 8px; line-height: 1.15; }
.page-sub { font-size: 13.5px; color: #64748b; margin: 0; font-weight: 600; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 6px 14px; background: #f1f5f9; border-radius: 50px; }
.page-body section { margin-bottom: 28px; }
.page-body h2 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 12px; letter-spacing: -0.3px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
.page-body h2 i { color: #0891b2; font-size: 15px; width: 20px; text-align: center; }
.page-body p { color: #334155; line-height: 1.75; font-size: 14.5px; margin: 0; }
.page-body ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 12px 0 0; }
.page-body ul li { padding: 8px 14px 8px 36px; position: relative; color: #334155; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 14px; background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.page-body ul li::before { content: '\f111'; font-family: 'Font Awesome 6 Free'; font-weight: 900; position: absolute; left: 16px; top: 11px; color: #0891b2; font-size: 5px; }
.page-body a { color: #0891b2; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
.page-body a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
.page-body strong { color: #0f172a; font-weight: 800; }
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .page { padding: 20px 12px 60px; }
  .page-container { padding: 32px 22px; border-radius: 16px; }
  .page-header h1 { font-size: 24px; }
  .page-icon { width: 54px; height: 54px; font-size: 22px; border-radius: 14px; }
  .page-body h2 { font-size: 16px; }
  .page-body p, .page-body ul li { font-size: 13.5px; }
}
</style>
